# SAUTI — Complete Product Generation Master Prompt

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior product designer, UX architect, full-stack software engineer, AI engineer and technical lead.

Your task is to design and build **SAUTI**, a complete, modern, voice-first English learning platform.

Do not build just a landing page, a dashboard mockup or a static prototype. Build a coherent, functional application with real navigation, learning activities, learner journeys, voice interactions, progress tracking and a maintainable backend architecture.

Think like a team building a serious EdTech product intended for real learners, parents, teachers and institutions.

Make thoughtful product decisions independently. Do not stop to ask me about minor design or implementation decisions.

